/24 subnet. node2 successfully reached node1's management API using the private cluster IP, demonstrating in-cluster reachability; no external-network reachability test was possible from evidence, but the bind-to-private-IP plus firewalld source restriction is a direct technical control.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-e704f41d6f234c82\",\"cmd-44f574bd7dd34d00\",\"cmd-fc67205551a44418\",\"cmd-3c6405a77c8c499e\",\"global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets\"]},{\"id\":\"restart-node1\",\"requirement\":\"Node1 restart evidence protocol: healthy baseline, restart ack, changed boot identity, recovered cluster/TLS state\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id 3dba43a5... and active service recorded before reboot; reboot acknowledged by connection drop; post-reboot boot_id changed to c144037d... (matching the fixed after_executor snapshot); cluster_status shows 3/3 running again and TLS/mTLS re-verified.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-86ebed2128a14fbc\",\"cmd-80553ae4e0cf4be8\",\"cmd-8c8b9a0ccd26452b\",\"cmd-c810d7357f5b42b8\",\"cmd-80c19fbfb5f04670\",\"cmd-529e919d52e14915\",\"global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity\"]},{\"id\":\"restart-node2\",\"requirement\":\"Node2 restart evidence protocol\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id 738d0aac...; reboot acknowledged; post-reboot boot_id 1078e434... matches fixed snapshot; cluster_status shows 3/3 running; mTLS re-verified against node2's IP with Verify return code 0.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-9b91442bac0f402d\",\"cmd-ffa55f84cc15413d\",\"cmd-ed6fcff1846441f2\",\"cmd-c57e2970d27f404e\",\"cmd-6d0cf890d5804454\",\"global:after_executor:node2:boot-identity\"]},{\"id\":\"restart-node3\",\"requirement\":\"Node3 restart evidence protocol\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id 2fc81aed...; reboot acknowledged; post-reboot boot_id 329346af... matches fixed snapshot; cluster_status shows 3/3 running; TLS enforcement re-verified (no-cert rejected, CA cert accepted) against node3.\",\